00:21:25.746 --> 00:21:31.152
TODAY'S MEETING IN MEMORY OF STEVE KELLERMAN WHO DIED ON

00:21:31.152 --> 00:21:34.355
APRIL 27TH AT THE AGE OF 83. STEVE WAS BORN IN 1941 AND GREW

00:21:34.355 --> 00:21:35.556
UP IN PHILADELPHIA. HIS FAMILY WAS TIGHT KNIT.

00:21:35.556 --> 00:21:38.959
HIS MOTHER WAS BORN INTO AN IMMIGRANT FAMILY LIVING ON THE

00:21:38.959 --> 00:21:42.497
LOWER EAST SIDE OF MANHATTAN. AFTER LIVING FOR A TIME IN NEW

00:21:42.497 --> 00:21:45.566
YORK, THE SIBLINGS SETTLED AROUND PHILADELPHIA

00:21:45.566 --> 00:21:46.767
AND REMAINED CLOSE FOR THE REST OF THEIR LIVES.

00:21:46.767 --> 00:21:50.704
STEVE'S MOTHER PASSED ON TO HIM A SENSE OF COMMUNITY AND CARE

00:21:50.704 --> 00:21:53.708
FOR OTHERS THAT STAYED WITH HIM THROUGHOUT HIS LIFE.

00:21:53.708 --> 00:21:57.440
AFTER GRADUATING FROM TEMPLE UNIVERSITY IN 1964, STEVE MOVED

00:21:57.440 --> 00:22:00.715
TO SAN FRANCISCO TO JOIN THE AIR FORCE RESERVES AND EARNED

00:22:00.715 --> 00:22:02.500
HIS MASTER'S DEGREE IN INDUSTRIAL PSYCHOLOGY AT SAN

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:04.985
FRANCISCO STATE UNIVERSITY. AFTER RECEIVING HIS MASTER'S,

00:22:04.985 --> 00:22:08.656
STEVE JOINED THE FEDERATED DEPARTMENT STORES INC THE

00:22:08.656 --> 00:22:09.724
PARENT COMPANY OF MACY'S IN THEIR H.R.

00:22:09.724 --> 00:22:12.927
DEPARTMENT. WHILE WORKING AT FEDERATED HE

00:22:12.927 --> 00:22:16.330
MET HIS FUTURE WIFE SUSAN WALKING DOWN UNION STREET ONE

00:22:16.330 --> 00:22:19.600
DAY IN 1970. STEVE ASKED STUART SUSAN WHO

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:21.200
WAS CARRYING A VACUUM SHE HAD BORROWED FROM A FRIEND IF HE

00:22:21.200 --> 00:22:23.204
COULD BORROW IT WHEN SHE WAS DONE.

00:22:23.204 --> 00:22:24.605
SUSAN, WHO DIED IN AUGUST OF LAST YEAR AND STEVE MARRIED A

00:22:24.605 --> 00:22:27.742
YEAR LATER AND REMAINED TOGETHER FOR THE REST OF THEIR

00:22:27.742 --> 00:22:30.544
LIVES. >> STEVE WAS AHEAD OF HIS TIME

00:22:30.544 --> 00:22:31.746
IN THE LATE 1970S DURING THE OIL EMBARGO.

00:22:31.746 --> 00:22:34.949
A PICTURE OF STEVE RIDING HIS BIKE ON HIS MORNING COMMUTE

00:22:34.949 --> 00:22:37.685
DOWNTOWN MADE THE FRONT PAGE OF THE SAN FRANCISCO CHRONICLE.

00:22:37.685 --> 00:22:41.622
AROUND THE SAME TIME HE FOUNDED HIS OWN CONSULTING FIRM

00:22:41.622 --> 00:22:42.890
KELLERMANN AND ASSOCIATES. KELLERMANN ASSOCIATES

00:22:42.890 --> 00:22:46.761
SPECIALIZED IN PUTTING TOGETHER AFFIRMATIVE ACTION HIRING PLANS

00:22:46.761 --> 00:22:50.431
FOR LARGE CORPORATIONS IN ALL ASPECTS OF HIS LIFE.

00:22:50.431 --> 00:22:52.967
STEVE TRIED TO BETTER HIS COMMUNITY IN THE 1970S.

00:22:52.967 --> 00:22:55.503
HE ORGANIZED HIS NEIGHBORS TO GET THE FIRST SPEED BUMPS ADDED

00:22:55.503 --> 00:22:58.372
ON CUMBERLAND STREET NEAR DELORES PARK.

00:22:58.372 --> 00:22:59.973
AFTER MOVING TO NO VALLEY, HE HELPED UNDERGROUND THE

00:22:59.973 --> 00:23:02.909
ELECTRICAL WIRES IN THE NEIGHBORHOOD ALTHOUGH HE FAILED

00:23:02.909 --> 00:23:04.111
TO ACCOMPLISH THAT GOAL FOR HIS OWN STREET.

00:23:04.111 --> 00:23:07.648
>> THROUGHOUT HIS PROFESSIONAL CAREER HE WAS INVOLVED IN THE

00:23:07.648 --> 00:23:11.510
BIG BROTHERS PROGRAM AS HIS OWN AS HIS OWN SON ZACH STARTED

00:23:11.510 --> 00:23:11.986
SCHOOL. STEVE JOINED THE BOARD OF

00:23:11.986 --> 00:23:15.522
TRUSTEES AT THE BRANDEIS LITTLE OLD SCHOOL ON BROTHERHOOD WAY.

00:23:15.522 --> 00:23:18.259
TODAY THE BRANDEIS SCHOOL IN HIS EARLY 60S, STEVE

00:23:18.259 --> 00:23:21.796
TRANSFORMED HIS FAVORITE WAY TO COMMUTE AND EXERCISE HIS BIKE

00:23:21.796 --> 00:23:25.666
INTO A WAY TO DO GOOD. HE SERVED AS A COACH FOR TEAM

00:23:25.666 --> 00:23:27.680
AND TRAINING, WRITING THOUSANDS OF MILES AND RAISING HUNDREDS

00:23:27.680 --> 00:23:30.137
OF THOUSANDS OF DOLLARS FOR LYMPHOMA RESEARCH.

00:23:30.137 --> 00:23:32.740
HE CONTINUED TO CYCLE INTO HIS 70S.

00:23:32.740 --> 00:23:36.277
>> AT 75 HE RODE AROUND LAKE TAHOE.

00:23:36.277 --> 00:23:37.811
>> STEVE STEVE'S LIFE FROM HIS CAREER TO HIS FREE TIME

00:23:37.811 --> 00:23:40.947
REVOLVED AROUND HIS LOVE FOR PEOPLE.

00:23:40.947 --> 00:23:44.551
HE WAS A SOCIAL GUY WITH A BIG PERSONALITY AND HE LOVED TO

00:23:44.551 --> 00:23:45.553
DANCE. OVER THE LAST DECADE STEVE

00:23:45.553 --> 00:23:48.556
STRUGGLED WITH DEMENTIA. HE MOVED INTO THE MEMORY CARE

00:23:48.556 --> 00:23:51.959
FACILITY IN THE FRANK RESIDENCE AT THE JEWISH HOME FOR THE LAST

00:23:51.959 --> 00:23:53.294
FOUR YEARS OF HIS LIFE. NEVERTHELESS, HE REMAINED THE

00:23:53.294 --> 00:23:56.430
LIFE OF THE PARTY FOR HIS GRANDDAUGHTER'S BAT MITZVAH.

00:23:56.430 --> 00:23:59.700
HE CAME IN A WHEELCHAIR BUT REFUSING TO BE SIDELINED HE HIT

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:03.370
THE DANCE FLOOR ONCE AGAIN. STEVE SURVIVED BY HIS SON ZACH,

00:24:03.370 --> 00:24:05.373
HIS DAUGHTER IN LAW ANDREA AND HIS TWO GRANDCHILDREN

00:24:05.373 --> 00:24:09.176
SHOSHANA AND JACOB. >> ASKED TO DESCRIBE HIS DAD'S

00:24:09.176 --> 00:24:10.782
,ZACH SAID HE WAS A FORCE HE NEVER FADED INTO THE CROWD.

00:24:10.782 --> 00:24:13.518
HE WAS ALWAYS IN THE FRONT. HE WAS ALWAYS THERE.

00:24:13.518 --> 00:24:17.118
STEVE KELLERMAN, YOU WILL BE MISSED.

00:24:17.188 --> 00:24:18.656
REST IN PEACE AND MAY YOUR MEMORY BE A BLESSING AND THE

00:24:18.656 --> 00:24:21.992
REST I SUBMIT. THANK YOU, MR. PRESIDENT.

00:24:21.992 --> 00:24:25.395
