01:37:07.624 --> 01:37:10.761
RECOGNIZING JUNE 6TH AS NATIONAL GUN VIOLENCE AWARENESS

01:37:10.761 --> 01:37:14.164
DAY HERE IN SAN FRANCISCO. GUN VIOLENCE HAS TAKEN TOO MANY

01:37:14.164 --> 01:37:17.567
LIVES, LEFT TOO MANY FAMILIES FOREVER CHANGED.

01:37:17.567 --> 01:37:23.173
LAST YEAR NEARLY 47,000 PEOPLE IN THIS COUNTRY WERE KILLED BY

01:37:23.173 --> 01:37:24.410
GUNS. 115,000 WERE WOUNDED.

01:37:24.410 --> 01:37:27.377
IT IS NOW THE LEADING CAUSE OF DEATH FOR CHILDREN AND TEENS

01:37:27.377 --> 01:37:31.915
IN THE UNITED STATES AND THIS PAIN IS NOT EVENLY SHARED.

01:37:31.915 --> 01:37:35.585
>> YOUNG PEOPLE BLACK AND BROWN COMMUNITIES AND URBAN

01:37:35.585 --> 01:37:38.585
NEIGHBORHOODS BEAR THE HEAVIEST BURDEN.

01:37:38.856 --> 01:37:42.926
BUT THESE ARE NOT JUST NUMBERS. THESE ARE PEOPLE A CHILD, A

01:37:42.926 --> 01:37:44.261
PARENT, A FRIEND WHOSE LIVES WERE STOLEN TOO SOON.

01:37:44.261 --> 01:37:47.263
>> WE ARE HERE TODAY TO REMEMBER THEM AND TO SAY THAT

01:37:47.263 --> 01:37:50.670
THEIR LIVES MATTERED. NATIONAL GUN VIOLENCE AWARENESS

01:37:50.670 --> 01:37:54.604
DAY WAS CREATED TO HONOR THE LIFE OF HADIYA PENDLETON, A 15

01:37:54.604 --> 01:37:58.542
