01:38:01.945 --> 01:38:03.213
ORANGE IN HER MEMORY. THE COLOR HUNTERS WERE FOR

01:38:03.213 --> 01:38:06.349
SAFETY AND STARTED A MOVEMENT THAT HAS REACHED ACROSS THE

01:38:06.349 --> 01:38:09.352
COUNTRY. ON JUNE 6TH THIS FRIDAY WE'LL

01:38:09.352 --> 01:38:12.623
WEAR ORANGE IN HONOR OF THE LIVES WE'VE LOST AND IN

01:38:12.623 --> 01:38:16.493
SOLIDARITY WITH THOSE STILL GRIEVING AND STILL PUSHING FOR

01:38:16.493 --> 01:38:17.560
CHANGE. >> HERE IN SAN FRANCISCO WE'VE

01:38:17.560 --> 01:38:21.231
MADE REAL PROGRESS. LAST YEAR WE SAW THE LOWEST

01:38:21.231 --> 01:38:24.167
NUMBER OF HOMICIDES SINCE THE 1960S AND THAT'S BECAUSE WE'VE

01:38:24.167 --> 01:38:28.380
INVESTED IN SAFETY, IN PREVENTION, IN TRUSTED

01:38:28.380 --> 01:38:30.841
COMMUNITY PARTNERS AND IN PUBLIC HEALTH APPROACHES TO

01:38:30.841 --> 01:38:31.908
VIOLENCE. >> BUT THE WORK IS FAR FROM

01:38:31.908 --> 01:38:34.908
OVER. PREVENTING GUN VIOLENCE MEANS

01:38:35.645 --> 01:38:38.649
DOING EVERYTHING WE CAN. PASSING STRONGER LAWS

01:38:38.649 --> 01:38:42.249
SUPPORTING SURVIVORS. REMOVING GUNS FROM DANGEROUS

01:38:42.452 --> 01:38:46.389
SITUATIONS AND BUILDING TRUST WHERE IT'S BEEN BROKEN.

01:38:46.389 --> 01:38:47.936
I'M GRATEFUL TO SO MANY OF MY COLLEAGUES WHO JOINED ME

01:38:47.936 --> 01:38:50.336
