01:39:03.840 --> 01:39:06.422
WORKERS AND THE FAMILIES WHO CARRY THIS FIGHT FORWARD EVERY

01:39:06.422 --> 01:39:09.422
DAY. YOUR COURAGE, YOUR FIERCE

01:39:09.625 --> 01:39:10.893
COMMITMENT TO THIS WORK ARE AN INSPIRATION.

