I HAVE PROFOUND ADMIRATION FOR THE WAY YOU TURN YOUR GRIEF

01:39:13.829 --> 01:39:17.299
INTO POWER TO INSPIRE LASTING CHANGE.

01:39:17.299 --> 01:39:18.367
>> SAN FRANCISCO STANDS WITH YOU.

01:39:18.367 --> 01:39:21.503
